# Cursor-only extra rules — not the workshop default
#
# Workshop default: edit ~/.agents/instructions/shared.md, then run
# wire-personal-agents.sh. That file is what Claude, Gemini, and Firebender
# should follow.
#
# Use this exclude list only if you also keep extra files under
# ~/.cursor/rules/*.mdc and still run sync-personal-rules.sh to mirror them
# into Claude. Copy to ~/.cursor/rules/.claude-exclude (one stem per line).
#
# Examples:
# creating-pull-requests
# context-baseline-html-report
